+## Left by 03
+
+- `adapt_today` and `change_mesocycle` are answered through the same `reading_today`, so the fix above covers them too: after the last cycle they also say `NO_MESOCYCLE`.
+- A change keeps the old `accepted_after` and stores `cycles` as cycles done before the current one plus the model's count (`mesocycles.record_change`). "The last cycle" is the stored total, so the trigger needs no special case for a changed mesocycle.
+- A change or an adaptation deletes today's served workout if nobody performed it (`mesocycles._withdrawn`). A prepared mesocycle accepted while today's serving is still outstanding should probably do the same; `record_mesocycle` does not today.
